{"data":[{"created_at":"2026-11-19T19:49:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2123503903685956025"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/yBd6nTIGZY","end":38,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/sahilmdkr/status/2123503903685956025/photo/1","media_key":"3_2123503899277479938","start":15,"url":"https://t.co/yBd6nTIGZY"},{"display_url":"x.com/trq212/status/…","end":62,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/trq212/status/2123457177419760100","start":39,"url":"https://t.co/Fh8dnu7Z08"}]},"id":"2123503903685956025","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":499,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2123457177419760100","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Big day indeed https://t.co/yBd6nTIGZY https://t.co/Fh8dnu7Z08"},{"created_at":"2026-11-19T14:00:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2123416007922344171"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"The simplest way to serve a model. Import weights, get an endpoint, pay for the tokens you use. Nothing billed while idle.","display_url":"cerebellumlabs.ai","end":250,"expanded_url":"https://cerebellumlabs.ai","images":[{"height":630,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2124779397601517568/pp2x1ZtV?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2124779397601517568/pp2x1ZtV?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":227,"status":200,"title":"Introducing Cerebellum Cloud","unwound_url":"https://www.cerebellumlabs.ai/","url":"https://t.co/Rd8vMOYdgh"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/MAjQqybEZd","end":274,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/sahilmdkr/status/2123416007922344171/video/1","media_key":"13_2123279335909953536","start":251,"url":"https://t.co/MAjQqybEZd"}]},"id":"2123416007922344171","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":491,"impression_count":95077,"like_count":556,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":99,"retweet_count":38},"text":"We believe every company should run its own custom models. But right now that means paying for a GPU by the hour.\n\nToday we’re launching Cerebellum Labs (YC W27). Custom models, priced per token.\n\n$25 in free credits to start: https://t.co/Rd8vMOYdgh https://t.co/MAjQqybEZd"},{"created_at":"2026-11-18T17:13:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2123102374361276467"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/suhaaspk/statu…","end":231,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/suhaaspk/status/2123095891221327877","start":208,"url":"https://t.co/QDa5sjaoSV"}]},"id":"2123102374361276467","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":293,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2123095891221327877","type":"quoted"}],"text":"A dedicated gpu with low utilization is about the worst case scenario for teams wanting to run their own model. Pooled makes a ton of sense in those cases to amortize costs across multiple model deployments. https://t.co/QDa5sjaoSV"},{"article":{"title":"Serving custom models efficiently with fast cold starts"},"created_at":"2026-11-13T16:48:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2121284035968139573"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2121…","end":248,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2121277020260749312","start":225,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2121277020260749312","url":"https://t.co/ckdSzCyNIs"}]},"id":"2121284035968139573","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":757,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"text":"How can we serve custom models efficiently at low or bursty traffic? Optimizing cold starts is a huge piece of the answer. \n\nWe cut cold start times from ~5 minutes down to 15 seconds, making custom model serving far cheaper https://t.co/ckdSzCyNIs"},{"created_at":"2026-11-11T15:44:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120543094483603939"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/bgZlL5bCYC","end":260,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/sahilmdkr/status/2120543094483603939/photo/1","media_key":"3_2120543005081759744","start":237,"url":"https://t.co/bgZlL5bCYC"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/bgZlL5bCYC","end":260,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/sahilmdkr/status/2120543094483603939/photo/2","media_key":"3_2120543018922950657","start":237,"url":"https://t.co/bgZlL5bCYC"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/bgZlL5bCYC","end":260,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/sahilmdkr/status/2120543094483603939/photo/3","media_key":"3_2120543036413251584","start":237,"url":"https://t.co/bgZlL5bCYC"}]},"id":"2120543094483603939","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":515,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2120539451856457997","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"Earlybird sits at the Pareto frontier for latency vs accuracy, and model size vs latency. Across a variety of datasets, it predicts words correctly before the speaker finishes them at a much higher rate than other comparable STT models. https://t.co/bgZlL5bCYC"},{"created_at":"2026-11-11T15:29:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120539463852204430"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"A tiny streaming speech-to-text model that predicts words before the speaker finishes saying them with a confidence score.","display_url":"sahilmahendrakar.com/writings/early…","end":29,"expanded_url":"https://sahilmahendrakar.com/writings/earlybird","images":[{"height":900,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120539469921284096/HzuSaz5I?format=png&name=orig","width":1600},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120539469921284096/HzuSaz5I?format=png&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":6,"status":200,"title":"Earlybird: predictive speech-to-text in 29M parameters","unwound_url":"https://www.sahilmahendrakar.com/writings/earlybird","url":"https://t.co/Wogvonlzdn"},{"description":"Streaming speech recognizers output a word only after the speaker has finished it, typically 90-400 ms later. For a voice agent every millisecond counts: the sooner the words are outputted, the...","display_url":"arxiv.org/abs/2611.14421","end":60,"expanded_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.14421","images":[{"height":1000,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120534781406433280/FBwjZ3Xd?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1000},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120534781406433280/FBwjZ3Xd?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":37,"status":200,"title":"Earlybird: Predictive Streaming Speech Recognition in 29M Parameters","unwound_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.14421","url":"https://t.co/9Kf2trka5K"},{"description":"Automatic Speech Recognition model. Download, explore files and run it on Hugging Face.","display_url":"huggingface.co/sahilmahendrak…","end":91,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/sahilmahendrakar/Earlybird-29M","images":[{"height":648,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120539486883069952/AmJmYZln?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120539486883069952/AmJmYZln?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":68,"status":200,"title":"sahilmahendrakar/Earlybird-29M · Hugging Face","unwound_url":"https://huggingface.co/sahilmahendrakar/Earlybird-29M","url":"https://t.co/2yP5VNh940"},{"description":"Contribute to sahilmahendrakar/earlybird development by creating an account on GitHub.","display_url":"github.com/sahilmahendrak…","end":121,"expanded_url":"https://github.com/sahilmahendrakar/earlybird","images":[{"height":600,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120539470332407808/I5cqjirr?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120539470332407808/I5cqjirr?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":98,"status":200,"title":"GitHub - sahilmahendrakar/earlybird","unwound_url":"https://github.com/sahilmahendrakar/earlybird","url":"https://t.co/VYhPdJMdfx"}]},"id":"2120539463852204430","lang":"da","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":32,"impression_count":996,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2120539460588736907","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"Blog: https://t.co/Wogvonlzdn\nPaper: https://t.co/9Kf2trka5K\nModel: https://t.co/2yP5VNh940\nCode: https://t.co/VYhPdJMdfx"},{"created_at":"2026-11-11T15:29:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120539460588736907"],"id":"2120539460588736907","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":858,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2120539458437255295","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"At 29M-parameters and 17MB, Earlybird is small enough to run on a CPU.\n\nEarlybird is fine-tuned from Moonshine Tiny, so a huge thanks to the team at Moonshine AI!"},{"created_at":"2026-11-11T15:29:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120539458437255295"],"id":"2120539458437255295","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":793,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2120539456398590095","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"For voice agents, every millisecond of latency counts. With Earlybird, voice agents can start a search, fetch a record, or plan a reply while the speaker is still talking."},{"created_at":"2026-11-11T15:29:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120539456398590095"],"id":"2120539456398590095","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":842,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2120539454599487518","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"Earlybird has strong accuracy for its size. On the 8 Open ASR Leaderboard sets it beats Moonshine Tiny on every one (mean WER 12.6 vs 14.4) at under half the size, and roughly ties Whistle."},{"created_at":"2026-11-11T15:29:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120539454599487518"],"id":"2120539454599487518","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1087,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2120539451856457997","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"Just like a human, Earlybird uses context and the first few sounds of a word to predict the word being spoken. Earlybird is trained on audio cut off partway through a word, and learns to output the whole word along with a confidence score."},{"created_at":"2026-11-11T15:29:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120539451856457997"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/B7T2emlYYC","end":302,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/sahilmdkr/status/2120539451856457997/video/1","media_key":"13_2120535921061744640","start":279,"url":"https://t.co/B7T2emlYYC"}]},"id":"2120539451856457997","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":410,"impression_count":13488,"like_count":428,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":40},"text":"I'm excited to release Earlybird: a 29M-parameter predictive speech-to-text model that outputs words before you finish saying them.\n\nMost streaming models wait 90-400ms after a word ends before outputting it. Earlybird predicts words correctly a median of 90 ms before they end. https://t.co/B7T2emlYYC"},{"created_at":"2026-11-10T18:32:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120223127925928249"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Text-to-Speech model. Download, explore files and run it on Hugging Face.","display_url":"huggingface.co/sahilmahendrak…","end":30,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/sahilmahendrakar/Paradee-8M-v1.3","images":[{"height":648,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119829927138627584/RctyBz1x?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119829927138627584/RctyBz1x?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":7,"status":200,"title":"sahilmahendrakar/Paradee-8M-v1.3 · Hugging Face","unwound_url":"https://huggingface.co/sahilmahendrakar/Paradee-8M-v1.3","url":"https://t.co/sIl0nIwKXj"},{"description":"TTS systems evaluated on objective metrics.","display_url":"huggingface.co/spaces/hf-audi…","end":67,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hf-audio/open_tts_leaderboard","images":[{"height":648,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2122292643283820544/TlGlXP-e?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2122292643283820544/TlGlXP-e?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":44,"status":200,"title":"Open TTS Leaderboard - a Hugging Face Space by hf-audio","unwound_url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hf-audio/open_tts_leaderboard","url":"https://t.co/kn3BYNIAaP"},{"description":"Paradee now speaks Hindi, French and Spanish along with English, without growing in size or losing quality on existing voices.","display_url":"sahilmahendrakar.com/writings/parad…","end":97,"expanded_url":"https://www.sahilmahendrakar.com/writings/paradee-1-3","images":[{"height":900,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119829912643047424/hwBBUUrF?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1600},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119829912643047424/hwBBUUrF?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":74,"status":200,"title":"Paradee 1.3: The smallest multilingual TTS model","unwound_url":"https://www.sahilmahendrakar.com/writings/paradee-1-3","url":"https://t.co/HUHzi2nNAq"}]},"id":"2120223127925928249","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":63,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2120223125799600346","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"Model: https://t.co/sIl0nIwKXj\nLeaderboard: https://t.co/kn3BYNIAaP\nBlog: https://t.co/HUHzi2nNAq"},{"created_at":"2026-11-10T18:32:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120223125799600346"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/w5SBiANwYu","end":120,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/sahilmdkr/status/2120223125799600346/photo/1","media_key":"3_2120222669572321280","start":97,"url":"https://t.co/w5SBiANwYu"}]},"id":"2120223125799600346","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":58,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2120223122498691093","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"In Spanish, Paradee v1.3 is fifth for WER (1.28) and is still the smallest model on the frontier https://t.co/w5SBiANwYu"},{"created_at":"2026-11-10T18:32:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120223122498691093"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/HYfF7BGjeY","end":165,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/sahilmdkr/status/2120223122498691093/photo/1","media_key":"3_2120222420388777984","start":142,"url":"https://t.co/HYfF7BGjeY"}]},"id":"2120223122498691093","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":64,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2120223119092634020","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"In French, Paradee v1.3 is third with 2.93, just ahead of Kokoro-82M at 2.99. OmniVoice (2.67) and phonon-40m-fr (2.89) are the two above it. https://t.co/HYfF7BGjeY"},{"created_at":"2026-11-10T18:32:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120223119092634020"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/lWorLns0tt","end":137,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/sahilmdkr/status/2120223119092634020/photo/1","media_key":"3_2120221852538699776","start":114,"url":"https://t.co/lWorLns0tt"}]},"id":"2120223119092634020","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":93,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2120223116861292616","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"In Hindi, Paradee v1.3 is 2nd for WER (2.62) behind only VoxCPM2. It's the smallest model on the Pareto frontier. https://t.co/lWorLns0tt"},{"created_at":"2026-11-10T18:32:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2120223116861292616"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/9wPZxN7gCN","end":118,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/sahilmdkr/status/2120223116861292616/photo/1","media_key":"3_2120221592